  "per_task_phase_time": "sum of the phase timers in a job's result.json (costs.wall_s); for FB pretraining plus the recorded replay_generation_s of its buffer, which the data-preparation step generated before and outside the timed jobs; ER_FB/DM_FB adaptation: the final-snapshot timer (costs.final_snapshot_s); used by tab_costs and tab_cost_components",
  "threshold_any_checkpoint": "a finite ER_FB/DM_FB curve meets the thresholds at some evaluated checkpoint if ER_FB at any FB snapshot, DM_FB after its 300 latent steps at any snapshot, or a DM_FB intermediate iterate (latent steps 50-250) at the final snapshot meets them; the convergence rule of the protocol (section 3) is unchanged",
  "unique_model_amortization": "pretraining divided by the number of distinct (layout, goal) tasks that adapt the same FB job in any final suite (core and compact ablations); results/tables/costs_*.csv (scripts/analyze.py) divide by the goals of the same suite only",
  "whole_job_wall_time": "attempt wall time in a job's status.json (start to end of the job: set-up, phases, checkpoints and output writing); excludes replay generation; used for the suite totals"
 },
